+It is DEAD in this engine's served DSpark trim path, which returns before this allocator expression. Do not port it there.
+0003 suppresses suffix copies while the draft head is loaded; it does not turn off the head, forced tokens or plain
+decoding. Native copies were capped at5 tokens and displaced a useful5-token head. Combined patches matched Python's
